---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Cookie Information">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 text-ink">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-serif mb-6">Cookie Information</h1>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <p>This website does not use tracking cookies or require a cookie consent banner.</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif mt-8 mb-4">Analytics</h2>
      <p>We use GoatCounter, a privacy-friendly analytics tool. It does not set cookies, does not track you across other websites, and does not collect personal data. It only records anonymous, aggregated page views to help us understand which parts of the site are most useful.</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif mt-8 mb-4">Theme Preference</h2>
      <p>If you switch between the Light, Dark, or Colourful themes, we store your preference in your browser's local storage. This is not a cookie, and the data is never sent to our servers.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>